Notes 
Since I started working on my personal website in 2023, I've done and built things that I wanted to share, but some of them felt too small or uninteresting for a full blog post. I figured it would be nice to create a place to collect these and that's what this page is for. 
I've set up an agent to scan my commits and suggest a note entry whenever I add something "interesting" so it this page should be pretty lively, like a mini-changelog. 
 Oct 12, 2026 
I added a small AI agent to this website. It can answer questions about me, my work and anything from my blog posts. At first I thought it was a bit of a gimmick, but I ended up liking it a lot. If you’re curious about something, feel free to ask it . 
 Oct 11, 2026 
I updated the styling of the demo components across the website. The toolbars and footers used to be full-width with a border on top. Now they’re a nested container. I prefer this look way more; it feels cleaner. 
